    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3faa5d482a84283b70352390",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好啊，先等我一下！我等下就过去──！\n……呼，小鬼们总是有用不完的精力，真够伤脑筋的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d8243dd7349378eb38d48116425141934d42ab8f4b13f0b8eca207a9d615ee0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
