    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc322d7c5bf8a65e0afa170",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫做玉藻十字。能这样认识也算是种缘分。\n我们同是身为菜鸟的身份，就各自好好努力吧！拜拜啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a2f12967122f08b858acb167f66833781ad1e7fc2bf6dd02f0eb42893331807",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1021/storytimeline_041021001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be8f422fc8a29bf4c8f6be4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知道她出道之后会展现什么样的跑法呢？\n我一边这么想，一边神清气爽地离开了公园……",
      "source_fingerprint": "45a138a6c8a7c4c59d625ab8e3f54141fbfe3c074e7674ae3cca52b3aac3ee4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1021/storytimeline_041021001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6afdd0c0006e1da0aff18c67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "过了一个礼拜后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4cd8d5bd8a0f44ca6c6cf3a75e6539ac4647c28318f489a7f458eba18a8b689",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1021/storytimeline_041021001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0090b47956563897afeffc5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于来到了选拔赛当天。\n我看着准备上场的赛马娘时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a366ab6a3876713ccfdd59103cf0c2870026804a15ea9e8e887fef8c0f4ce6c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1021/storytimeline_041021001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a96789d8361182a385310709",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过学园附近的公园时，听见了小朋友们玩耍的声音。\n于是我朝声音的方向看去──",
      "source_fingerprint": "496591b6154c43d73798523e72e31f435805d568f6282bcdcdf24ad5f6ea0e04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1021/storytimeline_041021001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:239c2a44ed469d553dac09d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……她是很紧张吗？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "20e5d45c155d87314044a3c160a13615bbfe7a64cd65f4a133e01968cd778497",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
