      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终，玉藻十字以没能上榜的成绩结束了比赛。\n在我看来……她似乎跑得非常紧绷，没有一点余力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad62d11e263a45c2dcaf0cf5102df7e6e0e39cbce0af64a447e563ec7b2694d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
